{"chunkId": "b187097e-4a77-51a8-81a6-f80ff4af12d6", "text": "自我解释：用自己的话解释学习材料中的概念、步骤和过程，将新信息与已有知识建立联系，从而促进深度理解和迁移能力。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "5c4f33c4-6989-5c0a-a5b6-97dbf1f0d143", "text": "自我解释的第 1 步：阅读学习材料中的概念或解题步骤。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "7ed9d991-4df8-5628-87cc-86f90eb41b88", "text": "自我解释的第 2 步：用自己的话解释每个概念的含义。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "d2024ea4-6fcd-5e07-a7e8-aac04cab3aa4", "text": "自我解释的第 3 步：解释不同概念之间如何关联。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "472e6683-5e78-5b12-978d-52f3cf5de8b8", "text": "自我解释的第 4 步：对于解题过程，解释每一步为什么要这样做。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "6a1f2924-b8f3-5617-a463-2a7cd1c0b043", "text": "自我解释的第 5 步：对照资料检查解释的准确性并修正。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 5, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "f74b1f70-da76-5461-b39a-76f3649f5267", "text": "自我解释适合需要理解复杂概念和过程的学习，原因是：自我解释能促使学习者将新信息与已有知识建立联系，显著促进近迁移和远迁移表现。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要理解复杂概念和过程的学习"}}
{"chunkId": "4a499baf-e751-5dbe-a9b6-322582276fab", "text": "自我解释适合数学、科学等问题解决型学科，原因是：在解题过程中进行自我解释，能有效提升问题解决能力和知识迁移能力。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "数学、科学等问题解决型学科"}}
{"chunkId": "b48798b5-02f7-5a31-b94f-b3c95ee4888d", "text": "自我解释不适合认知负荷已较高的学习者，原因是：自我解释需要额外的认知资源，对于认知负荷已接近饱和的学习者可能适得其反。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "认知负荷已较高的学习者"}}
{"chunkId": "4136c9df-c3b9-57ed-963f-4dc32869e53a", "text": "自我解释不适合时间紧迫的短期备考，原因是：自我解释会显著增加学习时间（30%-100%），在时间受限的情况下可能不划算。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-self-explanation", "strategyName": "自我解释", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "时间紧迫的短期备考"}}
